# =============================================================================
# Documentation — keep the canonical set, ignore scratch notes
# =============================================================================
*.md
!README.md
!README.zh-CN.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.md
!CLAUDE.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
